{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvavNSynTTuskscevhfK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't remove it yet. Treat the drop as a probable discoverability regression and investigate first.**\n\n**Why the data doesn't support removal**\n- The timing points to the redesign, not to waning demand. A 60% drop that starts the same week the toggle moved looks more like users can't find or understand the switch than like they stopped wanting it.\n- The silence in support tickets is weak evidence. People who can't find a setting rarely file tickets. They work around it or quietly churn, and offline users are often on poor connections, so they may also be the least likely to write in.\n- Removal is hard to reverse and the cost is uncertain. The code simplification is a known gain, but you'd be giving it up against an unmeasured loss.\n\n**Questions to answer first (a few days of analysis)**\n1. Is the drop in new activations or in active use among people who already enabled it? Activations only suggest a findability problem. A drop in existing users' use suggests the redesign broke or reset something.\n2. Does the settings-page funnel (views, then toggle taps) fall at the same point? Does the drop track app version rollout?\n3. Who was using it before? If they were heavy, retained or poor-connectivity users, the feature matters more than the raw count suggests.\n\n**Bounded next step**\n- Restore a prominent entry point, such as the old position or a prompt when connectivity is poor. Compare activations with a holdout, or compare before and after.\n- If usage recovers, keep the feature. If it stays low after findability is fixed, and the pre-redesign users were few and low-value, removal becomes a defensible call. Announce it and sunset it gradually.\n\nGive the product lead a cost estimate for maintaining offline mode. That makes the tradeoff concrete."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3447,"cache_read_input_tokens":4972,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3447},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dee66372-5a64-4804-94f1-42e611bcf151","uuid":"8df1c558-a293-4b51-ac56-bfd4b16e9cad","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:11:54.775Z","request_id":"req_011CfvavNANHSDGpwAWrf6Gx"}
